				<guid>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/code-name-the-truth</guid>
				<title>代号：████ ███ - 真相</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/code-name-the-truth</link>
				<description>

&lt;p&gt;要隐瞒SCP-001的真身，最简单的办法是什么？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-mebius&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4088015&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606830172&quot; alt=&quot;C Mebius&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4088015)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-mebius&quot;  &gt;C Mebius&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 24 Nov 2018 05:39:34 +0000</pubDate>
